{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "a7e22955b18d14272615739f155ca21d7f773a43aea0fafdbfa6dd80909019cb", "ja": "～因縁～", "zh": "～因缘～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "66927e0676fd38ebc9d6ea1f99127c2efe5dbe50908d7e2bbb63909325362ce6", "ja": "オートメーションりんご工場を作るためと、\r\n商店街の取り壊しを始める木下組。桃子と環\r\nは馴染みの街を守ろうと立ち上がるが、のり\r\n子の攻撃に環が倒れる。ひなたの煽りを受け\r\nた桃子は、組を継ぐと啖呵を切るのだった。", "zh": "为了建造自动化苹果工厂，木下组开始拆除商店街。桃子和环挺身而出，想要守护这条熟悉的街道，可环却被典子的攻击击倒。在雏田的挑衅下，桃子放出狠话，决定继承木下组。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1000_se", "source_sha256": "c7f72fce5ecfc18afd2538460d77475824979268820c78a34cbfd192ffffa495", "ja": "ゴゴゴ……", "zh": "轰隆隆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "140f421a2969665e2b1616af25fbbd0c11e8a034305d0ddfd73f4df09213ca4c", "ja": "なに、この音……なにしてるの？", "zh": "这是什么声音……你在做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "ff0ee7f9d818a1ea0c94e8236d85cb9d50e36d02a560433220bcff7febe4fff7", "ja": "大変だよ、お嬢！\n木下組の連中が商店街を……！", "zh": "大事不好了，大小姐！\n木下组的那帮家伙在商店街……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "8ced914992f088a63c655bb76942e2606626d38e3f5bd59f3d289a2d05a9af3b", "ja": "さあさあ、時代遅れの建物は、\nぜんぶまとめてつぶしていくべさ！", "zh": "来来来，把这些过时的建筑统统拆掉吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "f9c0a90d0c3bebc4f92a01df97eb41110849f33cc6ac1d19a74fa4a21b5bd544", "ja": "ちょっと、なんてことするの！？", "zh": "等等，你这是在做什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "2796b2804120d82192474f537f35cb318f4dad6c687896bf5858105eb3af66c4", "ja": "おやまぁ、桃子お嬢ちゃんでないかい。\nおーい、作業ストップだぁ！", "zh": "哎呀，这不是桃子大小姐吗？\n喂——都停下手里的活儿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "b3b92b0b015acdc226b7628f52a770a94901a8c599803b7ca52b70e70a190e37", "ja": "ここはオートメーションりんご工場として、\n木下組が有効活用させてもらおうと思ってねぇ。", "zh": "这里就作为自动化苹果工厂，让木下组好好利用起来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "235840946cd3682a7d7c5c8fe2b38ea826f091ca94b2cd7a56f4ddec4610f09d", "ja": "でも、ここにはまだ、商店街の人達が……！", "zh": "可是，这里还有商店街的大家……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "76b2c9a905c55b372be53da6ff5c81e9dfd856f28082d044ead53ea5679a5c44", "ja": "魅梨音組がなくなった今、\nお嬢ちゃんひとりじゃ、なぁんもできない。", "zh": "魅梨音组已经不在了，光凭小姐一个人，什么也做不了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "5baf0f871b9f7db505b84af2b00684db5e520cc64dea9fc3ae68b30841770fa5", "ja": "全部あたしに任せておけばいいんだよぉ。お父さんが\nいなくなったあと、広いお屋敷じゃあ寂しいっしょや？", "zh": "全都交给我就好了呀。你爸爸不在了以后，住在这么大的宅子里，肯定很寂寞吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "d9ebc306f5995e9f7caff9b24525214d538b693f747877c47b8cbabce1117f65", "ja": "お……お父さんを殺しておいて、よくもぬけぬけと！", "zh": "你……你杀了爸爸，居然还这么厚颜无耻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "e7dba32df07ae5cb002ad6c7e1e697acf9cf97209a624de95e443f80e9e9cec6", "ja": "ちくしょう、もう怒ったぞ！\n木下ひなた、ここであったが百年目だ！　かくご～！", "zh": "可恶，我真的生气了！\n木下日向，既然在这里遇到你，那就是你倒霉了！觉悟吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1012_se", "source_sha256": "08ee6830867e1625c459d22d6ffeb2e8644c045ae9ec01dda667c757520e366a", "ja": "パン、パン！", "zh": "砰、砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "dd64f4a5b653f7f2d0a46a7face8239f04bafad1cb2dabfd4404ed16d78ec5a4", "ja": "はっ！", "zh": "啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "1306a84699f8e725925432975693a0afa792e49d6260f77ed4992383dc25001e", "ja": "の、のりこ！？", "zh": "诺、则子！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "3299bb2f8db637c69e728cbe4a766e309589c70bf3f629266d7e9b6250a6307e", "ja": "チャカなんて、慣れないモノ使ってんじゃ……ない！", "zh": "别用枪这种不习惯的东西……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1016_se", "source_sha256": "cf5c2c8445a5d1e2a0b9e300f4ea9034c2855a6016857b30fe8932dff3fb3f0b", "ja": "ドスッ", "zh": "咚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "8446ef0ad619325df27793982768f4995893c1c3b62e06ef8b5fd901709c8199", "ja": "がっ！　……ううっ……。", "zh": "咔！……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "1d1e236e5a92407217fd2d99b6549e73b11b1003ca59cdb96da702e629bad722", "ja": "環！？　環、しっかりしてっ！", "zh": "环！？环，坚持住！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "cded074a4cca95ffad509e3433387976803964b70c064c8b32084c04615a1a53", "ja": "三下のしつけがなってないねぇ、桃子さん。\nでも、あたしは寛大だから、許してあげるべさ。", "zh": "手下的管教不太行嘛，桃子小姐。  \n不过，我很宽宏大量，就原谅你吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1020_049mom", "source_sha256": "e5a4c8a2d149ec0862b96ccc73fefc6c8496e51889503d167af3843de1fc2d03", "ja": "よく言うわ！　全部、あんたが絵を描いたんじゃない。\n任俠なら、正々堂々と勝負しなさいよ！", "zh": "亏你说得出口！这一切不都是你一手策划的吗？既然讲任侠，就堂堂正正地一决胜负啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1021_035hin", "source_sha256": "2c83fc4b3ef841be8de5b4f9e13140c4a6195ef64eb68ad35d6e4f73863ccd12", "ja": "任俠？　任俠道なんてカビの生えた代物を、\nまだ信じてるのかい？　お生憎様だねぇ。", "zh": "任侠？你还相信任侠道那种早已发霉的老古董吗？真是遗憾啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1022_035hin", "source_sha256": "ed535f7348e92f1da7c5c768c0a07be07e461935ea42b4634e365b515bc52bbe", "ja": "仁義だ任俠だなんて格好つけたって、何にも守れや\nしないんだよ。これが、新しい時代のやりかたなのさ。", "zh": "就算把仁义任侠挂在嘴边装腔作势，也什么都保护不了。这就是新时代的做法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1023_035hin", "source_sha256": "a1dfc7a594148ae769125cc624b23139250432581b89d15f7f88d37edec6f000", "ja": "魅梨音組はもうなくなったんだべさ。\nいいかげん、意地を張るのはやめて、さあさあ。", "zh": "魅梨音组已经不存在了。差不多该别再逞强了，来来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1024_035hin", "source_sha256": "4d8f99e5dbc1f95c44e7b0d61dd871199cd196df01f097e52e478c25e3179a13", "ja": "さあさあ、さあ！", "zh": "来嘛来嘛，来嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1025_049mom", "source_sha256": "f901934ce0a66af1805925781ef362a8e4c6ba2148534f015a2719ccb8dc89c2", "ja": "桃子が……るもん……。", "zh": "桃子……做就是了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1026_035hin", "source_sha256": "594004cc621fd2515b84f4d85851230c1920dafb522e8b8bad9a4ee05d8976a1", "ja": "ん～？　なんだって？", "zh": "嗯～？你说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1027_049mom", "source_sha256": "648a6fd52752b320aa7e1046af9eb23a563c7ea7639d398349a522a0943035f4", "ja": "も……桃子が、いるもん！\n……魅梨音組は、桃子が継ぐ！", "zh": "桃……桃子在呢！\n……魅梨音组，由桃子来继承！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1028_049mom", "source_sha256": "07a2a11257a381d2a563e00be6581f7c3a2be2e5d96c47b77d63a34eaaf26317", "ja": "ここは魅梨音のシマ。あんた達には指一本触れさせや\nしないんだから……桃子は魅梨音組組長だよっ！！", "zh": "这里是魅梨音组的地盘。才不会让你们碰这里一根手指头……桃子可是魅梨音组的组长啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1029_040tam", "source_sha256": "f36683dfe90ec91c0c2ac991d10bede5005ba77509663906ad2a351a9f4efad2", "ja": "お嬢……！", "zh": "大小姐……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1031_035hin", "source_sha256": "ca4a0f6b553df2b85c375711385e900f8ae3dee4168e034dd8296668d5abfef6", "ja": "へえ、そうかいそうかい。それがあんたの決断かい？\n道理のわからん娘っこだべさ。仕方がない。", "zh": "哦，是这样啊，是这样啊。这就是你的决定吗？\n真是个不明事理的小丫头啊。那也没办法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_04_1032_035hin", "source_sha256": "5f094e91251a1474b5b16f82e70cee85aeb5b7cac1aed03208c89a36fecf3098", "ja": "今日のところは、引き上げておいてあげるよ。でも……\nじきに、後悔することになるからねぇ？", "zh": "今天就先放你一马吧。不过……你很快就会后悔的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
